# Optional. When unset, the app uses the in-browser demo market (MSW).
# Point at a running berth-market (default listen is http://127.0.0.1:8787).
# The browser never fetches this origin directly (no CORS on the market).
# Vite proxies same-origin /mkt → this URL. Restart `npm run dev` after changing.
# VITE_MARKET_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787

# Optional loopback Berthos node for GET /v1/eligibility and lease view URLs.
# Same role as BERTHOS_URL on the market. Leave unset in CI (mocked).
# Vite proxies same-origin /bos → this URL.
# VITE_BERTHOS_URL=http://127.0.0.1:7432

# Never set CDP keys, wallet secrets, or a mainnet facilitator in this repo.
# Staging network is Base Sepolia (eip155:84532). Mainnet is off in this UI.
# New listings default to Sepolia USDC. Stored eip155:8453 rows are not rewritten.
# MemoryWallet (market npm start): this UI POSTs /wallets/agent + fund for test:<walletId>.
# WALLET_ADAPTER=cdp / live facilitator: Pay with test signature stays disabled.
